  "implemented": [
    "Guarded atomic case/membership genesis and exact model/requirement/method/link capture; native genesis/journal/control/ownership validation and bounded get/locate.",
    "Explicit complete per-method criterion results, conditions, supporting facets and owned execution registry in one native/receipt/outcome transaction. Recording does not select favorable results or create a verified conclusion.",
    "Prior receipts require explicit rationale and matching native governing semantics, preserve original actor/time/facts and expose original input state separately from the new interpretation record.",
    "Response-byte refusal before success publication and transaction-local completion assertions after capture/journal insertion; postcondition/read failure rolls back every staged native/evidence/index/outcome write.",
    "Shared core, typed HTTP/client, CLI and shared UI outcome inspection. No physical migration, new ledger, new primitive or automatic retry."
  ],
